<Base title="About FreeJapaneseAcademy" description="Learn about FreeJapaneseAcademy's goal: accessible, carefully structured, free Japanese education for English-speaking learners." breadcrumbs={[{label:'About',href:'/about/'}]}>
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">OUR PHILOSOPHY</span><h1>Good learning should<br/><span class="red-text">be open to everyone.</span></h1><p>FreeJapaneseAcademy is being created to make the journey into Japanese clearer, more welcoming, and accessible without a paywall.</p></div></section>
  <article class="prose-page"><h2>Built for the long journey</h2><p>Japanese is a rich language that rewards patient, consistent learning. Our goal is a complete path from your first writing characters to advanced reading and comprehension, organized around the N5–N1 proficiency levels.</p><h2>Understand, don't just memorize</h2><p>Our planned courses will connect concepts to everyday examples, explain grammar in approachable English, and reinforce learning through practice and review. Content will be developed and checked progressively.</p><h2>Free and approachable</h2><p>Learning resources on FreeJapaneseAcademy are intended to be free. The current website is a foundation and preview, not yet a complete JLPT preparation service. You can explore the structure, try a sample lesson, and save progress locally without creating an account.</p><a href="/learn/" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:26px">Explore the learning path ↗</a><p style="margin-top:24px">Have a question or spotted an issue? <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Get in touch with FreeJapaneseAcademy</a>.</p></article>
</Base>
